## SideWinder Phase 2 ##
Now that the core product (the parametric path generator) is built and works successfully, we can move to phase 2 which is expanded functionality. 
The two main issues with the tool are that it has the name "Axis Spline" and not "SideWinder Paramentric Spline Tool" at the top visible to the user, and it cannot chain selections along otherwise valid 'discrete' paths and a sketch generated by the tool is not driven by other changes to the drawings that originally composed it.
To address the first problem, we need to elimnate the mention of Axis Spline everywhere but folder names. Anything in a menu or installer that someone sees should have the branding of "SideWinder Parametric Spline Tool"
To address the second problem, we will want to simply allow chaining of selections (and perhaps even tangent selections if available) along valid paths just like is allowed in sweep operations
